522	  // RESERVE the first-month-free credit BEFORE opening the Checkout session. This is
523	  // the money-race fix: the card leg settles the discounted price up front, so unless
524	  // this account/IP's one credit is held EXCLUSIVELY here, two concurrent card
525	  // checkouts could each pass eligibility and each collect a free month from one
526	  // eligibility. The reserve's INSERT contends on the same two unique constraints as
527	  // the grant, so exactly one checkout holds it; a loser re-quotes at FULL price so
528	  // its stamped total, card leg and settlement all agree (displayed === charged). The
529	  // hold is CONFIRMED at fulfilment, RELEASED on `checkout.session.expired`, and
530	  // swept as a backstop — an abandoned checkout never permanently burns the offer.
531	  //
