533	  // (0 whenever the promo is off, already-redeemed via the re-quote above, or the
534	  // product is out of scope — firstMonthFreeAppliesTo). It is 0 for VPS today, so
535	  // this block is inert for VPS and correct the moment the owner extends the promo to
536	  // any card-checkout product.
